SUMMARY:Door 1: Lock the front door
DESCRIPTION:DO: Turn on multi-factor authentication for email\, banking and
  work - passkeys or an authenticator app first.\nDON’T: Approve a sign-i
 n prompt you didn’t start. A flood of prompts is an attack\, not a glitc
 h.\n\nLesson learnt (Change Healthcare\, Feb 2024): Attackers used stolen 
 credentials on a remote-access portal that had no MFA. The ransomware atta
 ck disrupted US healthcare payments and exposed data on about 190 million 
 people.\n\nOpen the door: https://aware-by-design.github.io/CyberAIAdvent2
 026/?day=1&mode=full\n\nAI-assisted · an initiative of ENISA’s ARCH AHW
 G
