SUMMARY:Door 4: Polished isn’t proof
DESCRIPTION:DO: Check the real sender address\, hover before you click\, an
 d use the Report button.\nDON’T: Read perfect grammar as a sign of safet
 y - AI makes fluent\, personalised phishing cheap.\n\nLesson learnt (ENISA
  Threat Landscape\, 2025): Phishing was the leading way in\, at about 60% 
 of observed intrusions. By early 2025\, AI-supported phishing made up over
  80% of social-engineering activity worldwide.\n\nOpen the door: https://a
 ware-by-design.github.io/CyberAIAdvent2026/?day=4&mode=full\n\nAI-assisted
  · an initiative of ENISA’s ARCH AHWG
