SUMMARY:Door 17: Never trust the output
DESCRIPTION:DO: Validate and encode model output before it reaches a browse
 r\, shell or database - and fail closed on errors.\nDON’T: Pipe LLM outp
 ut into eval()\, SQL or innerHTML\, or skip a check when a service times o
 ut.\n\nLesson learnt (Vanna.AI\, Jun 2024): A prompt-injection flaw (CVE-2
 024-5565) let attackers run code\, because the library executed chart code
  the model had written.\n\nOpen the door: https://aware-by-design.github.i
 o/CyberAIAdvent2026/?day=17&mode=full\n\nAI-assisted · an initiative of E
 NISA’s ARCH AHWG
