SUMMARY:Door 20: A safe word for the family
DESCRIPTION:DO: Agree a family safe word for emergency calls and messages.\
 nDON’T: Send money on an urgent call from a “relative” or VIP - hang
  up and call back on a known number.\n\nLesson learnt (A cloned minister\,
  Feb 2025): Scammers cloned the voice of Defence Minister Guido Crosetto t
 o ask business leaders for money. At least one paid about €1 million bef
 ore police froze the funds.\n\nOpen the door: https://aware-by-design.gith
 ub.io/CyberAIAdvent2026/?day=20&mode=full\n\nAI-assisted · an initiative 
 of ENISA’s ARCH AHWG
