SUMMARY:Door 24: Ready when the office is empty
DESCRIPTION:DO: Staff an on-call rota\, route alerts to a human\, and keep 
 the incident plan and contacts offline.\nDON’T: Trust backups you’ve n
 ever restored - follow 3-2-1 and test a restore before the break.\n\nLesso
 n learnt (British Library\, Oct 2023): Rhysida ransomware crippled service
 s for months. The library’s own lessons-learned report pointed to remote
  access without MFA and legacy systems.\n\nOpen the door: https://aware-by
 -design.github.io/CyberAIAdvent2026/?day=24&mode=full\n\nAI-assisted · an
  initiative of ENISA’s ARCH AHWG
