SUMMARY:Door 27: Famous face\, fake offer
DESCRIPTION:DO: Treat celebrity investment ads and “guaranteed returns”
  as scams\, and check your financial regulator’s warning list.\nDON’T:
  Trust a video because the face is famous - deepfaked endorsements are a s
 cam staple.\n\nLesson learnt (Martin Lewis deepfake\, Jul 2023): A deepfak
 e video of the UK consumer champion promoting an “investment” app spre
 ad on social media. He warned the public it was a scam.\n\nOpen the door: 
 https://aware-by-design.github.io/CyberAIAdvent2026/?day=27&mode=full\n\nA
 I-assisted · an initiative of ENISA’s ARCH AHWG
