SUMMARY:Door 28: Map your AI\, keep a human
DESCRIPTION:DO: Inventory your AI tools and the personal data they touch\, 
 train staff (EU AI Act Art. 4)\, and run DPIAs where GDPR requires.\nDON
 ’T: Let AI decide about customers or candidates with no human review - y
 ou own what your bot says.\n\nLesson learnt (Air Canada\, Feb 2024): A Can
 adian tribunal held the airline liable after its website chatbot gave a cu
 stomer wrong refund advice\, rejecting the idea that the bot was a separat
 e entity.\n\nOpen the door: https://aware-by-design.github.io/CyberAIAdven
 t2026/?day=28&mode=full\n\nAI-assisted · an initiative of ENISA’s ARCH 
 AHWG
